@startuml
title ApexAuto Cloud Deployment Diagram

top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Customer" as Customer

node "User Device" as Device {
    artifact "Web Browser" as Browser
}

node "GitHub Platform" as GitHub {
    artifact "Shared Team Repository\nMJAlconcel8/apexauto" as SharedRepository
    artifact "Personal Deployment Fork\nTuLe1212/apexauto\nBranch: deploy/vercel-railway" as DeploymentRepository

    SharedRepository -down-> DeploymentRepository : Forked from shared team repository\nTeam changes synchronized
}

cloud "Vercel Cloud Platform" as Vercel {
    node "Static Frontend Hosting" as FrontendHosting {
        artifact "ApexAuto Frontend\nReact 19\nTypeScript\nVite 8\nProduction SPA" as Frontend
    }
}

cloud "Railway Cloud Platform" as Railway {
    node "Backend Service\nDocker Container" as BackendNode {
        artifact "ApexAuto Spring Boot API\nJava 21\nSpring Boot 4.1\nSpring Security\nSpring Data JPA\nModular Monolith" as Backend
    }

    database "Railway Managed MySQL\nApplication Database" as Database
}

cloud "Google Gemini API" as Gemini
cloud "External SMTP Service" as SMTP

Customer --> Browser : Uses ApexAuto
Browser --> Frontend : HTTPS\nLoads the web application
Frontend --> Backend : HTTPS REST / JSON\nHTTP-only JWT cookie

Backend --> Database : JDBC / MySQL\nPrivate Railway connection
Backend --> Gemini : HTTPS\nChatbot requests
Backend --> SMTP : SMTP + STARTTLS\nVerification and reset emails

DeploymentRepository --> FrontendHosting : Vercel builds and deploys\nthe frontend
DeploymentRepository --> BackendNode : Railway builds the Docker image\nand deploys the backend

note right of SharedRepository
Shared repository used by the
project team for collaboration.
end note

note right of DeploymentRepository
Personal fork used for deployment
testing and production deployment.
end note

note right of Frontend
Frontend configuration:
VITE_API_BASE_URL
end note

note right of Backend
Railway environment variables:
SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL
SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME
SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD
JWT_SECRET
JWT_EXPIRATION_TIME
GEMINI_API_KEY
MAIL_HOST
MAIL_PORT
MAIL_USERNAME
MAIL_PASSWORD
end note

@enduml
